        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-27T11:48:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I scoff at such statements.&nbsp; There is no One True Way, although my way is of course the truest one for my purposes.&nbsp; Randomization is worthless to me, and Advanced status is correct only about 2/3 of the time...sometimes I'm not up for a long, grueling battle and just want some light entertainment.</p>",
