      {
        "id": 82684,
        "name": "byc",
        "username": "byc",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/ebca7d/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-27T17:20:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Envisioner\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Envisioner:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I scoff at such statements.&nbsp; There is no One True Way, although my way is of course the truest one for my purposes.&nbsp; Randomization is worthless to me, and Advanced status is correct only about 2/3 of the time…sometimes I'm not up for a long, grueling battle and just want some light entertainment.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Then don't play it.&nbsp; I didn't say it was right for you.</p>",
