        "created_at": "2013-11-27T21:53:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Chaosmancer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/chaosmancer/48/1977_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Chaosmancer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I thought he was just making a joke, Kind of like when Ronway talks  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Ouch, fortunately I have this lovely rope to aid me in this time of need.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/2/270af8bcbac127eefcb758a17fc2ad44f6f1e9d0.png\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/270af8bcbac127eefcb758a17fc2ad44f6f1e9d0\" title=\"photo HangingRonway2_zps1dec9950.png\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/2/270af8bcbac127eefcb758a17fc2ad44f6f1e9d0.png\" alt=\"photo HangingRonway2_zps1dec9950.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"5zo7VRtzoXtTfUrO7Mki6ZdPt5e\" width=\"130\" height=\"171\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">photo HangingRonway2_zps1dec9950.png</span><span class=\"informations\">130×171 28.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
