        "created_at": "2013-11-29T17:01:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The noose didn't tighten, it's clearly a trick, and the cursed Acolyte would make a great villain. &nbsp;Lots to explore there, What is the source of the curse? &nbsp;Is he a werewolf? &nbsp;Does he burn with unholy fire still, now that Gloomweaver is gone? &nbsp;Or maybe he finds Ronway and turns his life into a force for good, and thus could get a hero deck.</p>",
